 def cell(x,name):return x['cells'][name]['correct']
 lines=['# V154 — three-cycle native bridge diagnosis','','**Status: bounded exercise complete; independent audit accepted. No established improvement in unseen addition.** The user assigned V154 because Claude is working on V153. The provisional design was preserved, the execution used separate folders and the fresh V154 RNG/world namespace. No core is adopted.','','The objective remains retained complete own-byte/EOS unseen-addition generalization per total feedback and actual compute. Candidate learning stayed in the native Full151/R_center path with gradual warmup and local signed writes. External linear fits were evaluator instruments; they never generated native answers or supplied native updates. No arithmetic feature/rule, attention, Transformer, ELM candidate, forced EOS or extra task was introduced.','','## Native acquisition and retention','','All counts below are complete payload plus the model\'s own EOS. Each row is one data world, with W/SH_OLD/N_OLD as correlated histories. OLD-end and NEW-end scores have 64 questions each; final OLD is after NEW and idle.','','| Configuration | World suffix | OLD end | NEW end | Final W OLD | Immediate exact /1,536 | Held admitted |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|']
 for x in native:lines.append(f"| {x['config']['id']} | {str(x['world'])[-4:]} | {x['readiness']['OLD_after']}/64 | {x['readiness']['NEW_after']}/64 | {cell(x,'W_POST_IDLE_OLD')}/64 | {x['immediate_exact']} | {'yes' if x['ready'] else 'no'} |")
 lines+=['',f"Immediate complete-answer acquisition was {immediate_correct}/{immediate_total} across updating native presentations. Immediate success and end-of-phase retrieval are distinct; neither a transient correct answer nor a lower teacher-forced loss establishes retained rule learning.",'','## Conditional unseen addition','','All acquisition/retention reports and admission decisions were hash-locked across the roster before any held score. Unready groups have no held score; they are not assigned zero accuracy. These two worlds provide descriptive development evidence only.']
 lines+=['','### Paired input-path effects','','All entries are percentage-point differences in complete accuracy; the immediate column is per updating presentation. These are descriptive within-world contrasts, not independent trial counts. Native effective write gains differ across front ends, so these are complete input-path effects.','','| World / measure | PERM at fast | PERM at slow | Slow at identity | Slow at PERM | Interaction |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
