 counts=load(H/'COUNTS.json');c=counts['counts'];lines+= [f"- {c['record_applications']:,} physical/presented record applications and {c['observed_targets']:,} reply/EOS target positions: native {c.get('native_records',0):,}, feature collection {c.get('feature_records',0):,}, online instruments {c.get('online_probe_records',0):,}, technical {c.get('technical_records',0):,}.",f"- {c['pair_queries']:,} own/teacher-forced query pairs and {c['probe_TF_records']:,} instrument teacher-forced record evaluations. Evaluator labels are accounted separately from feedback writes.",f"- {c['batch_evaluations']:,} batch objective/gradient evaluations and {c['batch_virtual_target_reuses']:,} virtual target reuses. Internal optimizer reuse is not hidden as new independent experience.",f"- Main controller, including its waited independent audit: {counts['CPU']:.2f} CPU seconds; peak main RSS {counts['RSS_peak_bytes']/2**20:.1f} MiB. One worker and one numerical thread. Saved-response postprocessing and packaging costs are recorded separately.",'','The target budget includes warmup, repeated presentations and write-inhibited histories. There are 128 unique taught relations/world, not one new arithmetic fact per presentation. Exact and canonicalized lookup can recite taught facts and cannot substantiate E3. External evaluators, pretrained checkpoint attribution and native learning results remain separate. Frozen historical sources and the arithmetic-design pointer were preserved; no automatic promotion, confirmation, extra n or GitHub upload occurred.','','Recorded departures and the preserved/resolved logging failure are detailed in PROTOCOL_REVIEW.md. Native curves are plotted in ACQUISITION_TARGETS.png and ACQUISITION_CPU.png. Actual KC dimension was 5,177, not a historical approximate KC count. Full-KC instruments have 1,330,489 parameters (about 10.15 MiB per float64 matrix); C16 instruments have 82,832 (about 0.632 MiB). L-BFGS uses additional vectors. Global encoding sorts and minimum counted clone movement are retained in COUNTS.json; peak RSS includes the interrupted controller and its continuation.','','See REVISED_DESIGN.md, SUMMARY.json, FINAL_AUDIT.json, ANALYSIS.json and the compact RESULT_BUNDLE.zip. Raw datasets, detailed per-query rows and checkpoints remain local.']
